cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: albireo
abstract: "GPU-accelerated Bayesian spectral disentangling of double- and multiple-lined spectroscopic binaries. albireo jointly infers the orbital elements and the individual component spectra from a time series of composite spectra, marginalizing the component spectra analytically so that only the low-dimensional orbit is sampled, and reporting posterior uncertainties on both."
type: software
authors:
